          </header> <!-- Stats Strip --> <div class="stats-strip" data-astro-cid-evryfnm7> <div class="stat-cell" data-astro-cid-evryfnm7> <div class="stat-num" data-astro-cid-evryfnm7>6</div> <div class="stat-label" data-astro-cid-evryfnm7>Entry Pathways</div> </div> <div class="stat-cell" data-astro-cid-evryfnm7> <div class="stat-num" data-astro-cid-evryfnm7>20+</div> <div class="stat-label" data-astro-cid-evryfnm7>Hospitality Roles</div> </div> <div class="stat-cell" data-astro-cid-evryfnm7> <div class="stat-num" data-astro-cid-evryfnm7>6</div> <div class="stat-label" data-astro-cid-evryfnm7>Career Routes</div> </div> </div> <!-- Opening Hook --> <div class="article-body" data-astro-cid-evryfnm7> <p data-astro-cid-evryfnm7><strong data-astro-cid-evryfnm7>The real question isn't "Will I get into IHM?"</strong></p> <p data-astro-cid-evryfnm7>
Most students think hospitality is just about "working in hotels" -
