</div> <!-- Critical Change Warning --> <div class="callout callout-info" data-astro-cid-evryfnm7> <strong data-astro-cid-evryfnm7>⚠️ Post-Pandemic Hospitality Shifts (2024-25)</strong><br data-astro-cid-evryfnm7>
The hospitality industry has transformed: contactless check-ins,
