</div> <!-- Market Reality Data --> <div class="callout" data-astro-cid-evryfnm7> <strong data-astro-cid-evryfnm7>Hospitality Market Reality (2024 data)</strong><br data-astro-cid-evryfnm7>
India's hospitality sector projected to reach $48B by 2027. Bangalore
          alone has 200+ hotels across segments, with 15-20% annual growth in
