          and network - not just credentials.<br data-astro-cid-evryfnm7> <em data-astro-cid-evryfnm7>Source: FHRAI Industry Report 2024, STR Global Bangalore Market Data, IHM Placement Reports</em> </div> <!-- Your Admission Roadmap --> <h2 data-astro-cid-evryfnm7>Your Admission Roadmap</h2> <p data-astro-cid-evryfnm7>
