</p> </div> </div> <div class="step" data-astro-cid-evryfnm7> <div class="step-num" data-astro-cid-evryfnm7>2</div> <div class="step-body" data-astro-cid-evryfnm7> <h3 data-astro-cid-evryfnm7>Phase 2: Strategic Research</h3> <p data-astro-cid-evryfnm7>
